{"id":"689c9916fcffb575","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-pi11.md","title":"无实参数的有效余解析类","display":"df-pi11 — 无实参数的有效余解析类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-pi11","aliases":["43-df-pi11"],"display":"df-pi11 — 无实参数的有效余解析类","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-sigma11]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: higher setting, Chong–Nies–Yu §2; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-pi11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-pi11</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi11 — 无实参数的有效余解析类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" href=\"?note=fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" title=\"43-df-sigma11\">43-df-sigma11</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: higher setting, Chong–Nies–Yu §2; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> 的整数域与 Cantor 空间形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" href=\"?note=fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" title=\"43-df-sigma11\">43-df-sigma11</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:2^\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:2^\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持 lightface 无实参数层级；整数和 Cantor 空间类的补集论域分别显式给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigma11","status":"resolved","id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sigma11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\Sigma^1_1$ 的整数域与 Cantor 空间形式见 [[43-df-sigma11]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigma11","status":"resolved","id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\Sigma^1_1$ 的整数域与 Cantor 空间形式见 [[43-df-sigma11]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:2^\\omega\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1322,"backlinks":[{"id":"5bdf9b99211ed117","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，有效解析与余解析类见 [[43-df-sigma11]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 是自然数集合的类；$\\le_h$ 同时接受集合及特征序列。"},{"id":"32a84b7035b1fc0b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\#_2$ 与配对 $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。下式的 $S$ 是自然数集合，串索引通过显式配对编码进入 $S$。"},{"id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega)$ 见 [[43-df-pi11]]，$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度。本页为任意 $E\\subseteq2^\\omega$ 内建外测度 $\\mu^*$，不假定上游已定义完备化。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-509","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11]] — 无实参数的有效余解析类"},{"id":"7451543a13fa63dd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-pi11random]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。"},{"id":"6bacc140319ebf3e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["565c3258eee2a5ff","fd20d0fb1ced54f7"]}